ike_count":16,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"有什么方法能删除看过这段文字的记忆？ https://t.co/ChncaTot0K","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2118926416989618355"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-07T04:10:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118919010477805629"],"id":"2118919010477805629","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2551,"like_count":29,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":0},"text":"上海不属于中国了吗？我不知道服务员一句中文都不会说什么意思","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2118919010477805629"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-07T03:45:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118912576000319593"],"id":"2118912576000319593","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1390,"like_count":35,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"1966年美国就有了《动物福利法》。老中觉得自己搞不了，说什么人权都保护不了，还保护动物\n\n那么也就是现在，连1966年的美国都比不上","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2118912576000319593"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-07T03:20:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118906284523073608"],"id":"2118906284523073608","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":9037,"like_count":216,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":6},"text":"部分中国人的世界观：\n\n美国是枪战斩杀线，加拿大到处是大麻，南美是毒枭窟，欧洲是吹不起空调移民小偷，澳新是山火大蜘蛛，非洲是霍乱贫穷，俄罗斯人都打熊喝伏特加，韩国吃不起西瓜，日本是我们的，东南亚都是电诈割腰子，咋妈把我们保护得太好了","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2118906284523073608"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-07T02:55:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118899992911810712"],"id":"2118899992911810712","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":8123,"like_count":55,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"text":"年初我朋友美签面试被拒了，我问她是什么原因\n\n她说面试官问她去美国哪里的时候，她说她要去参观911遗址……我不懂她……🚬","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2118899992911810712"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-11-07T02:30:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118893701233844365"],"id":"211889370123384